OL,3,GNEWSALong delays following lorry fire
OL,4,Aon M25
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists are facing long delays after
OL,7,Fa lorry fire on the M25 in Surrey,
OL,8,Faccording to travel monitoring site
OL,9,FInrix.
OL,11,FTwo lanes were closed on the
OL,12,Fanti-clockwise carriageway between
OL,13,Fjunction 13 for Staines and the M3
OL,14,F(junction 12).
OL,16,FThe incident was reported just before
OL,17,F06:30 GMT on Thursday.
OL,19,FAt about 08:45, Inrix reported all
OL,20,Flanes had reopened but with delays of
OL,21,F30 minutes between junction 15 for the
OL,22,FM4 and the M3.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
